<title>UK: LucasVarity buys back more shares at 185p.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity buys back more shares at 185p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-American engineering firm LucasVarity Plc said on Thursday it bought 1.0 million of its shares at 185p per share as part of its ongoing stock buyback plan.</p>
<p>The purchase represented 0.07 percent of the firm's ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>The company's shares slipped 1.5p to close at 185.</p>
<p>In April, the firm said it planned to buy back 80 million stg of shares under its stock buyback plan. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
